      "ui:While the days flow (or fast-forward), the chosen kinds of events resolve themselves. Every outcome is written to the Chronicle.": R["e1196594"],
      "ui:While this declaration remains recent, player-realm vassal breakaway pressure is ×{multiplier}; poor Standing raises it further.": R["4701ad32"],
